Z||000000||burdell1||05-07-99||10:45 PM||||My '85 Fiero's passenger headlight will go down and that is it.(I just leave them in the up position all the time.)  I replaced the isolator relay, so I know it is not that. Does anyone out there have a wiring charts  for the 84 or 85 Fieros?
